<Page path="/about" eyebrow="about" title="a quiet room, kept on purpose." description="what bosley is, who writes it, and why it has no accounts, ads or tracking.">
  <p>bosley is a small place for writing and for answering it. it was started in 2024 by asher newton, and it's kept by zorak corp.</p>
  <p>most of the internet is built to keep you scrolling. this is built so you can leave. the writing is in order, newest first. there's an end to the page. no one is counting how long you stayed.</p>
  <h2>how it works</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>no accounts.</strong> there's nothing to sign up for. you read, and if you want to, you say something.</li>
    <li><strong>anonymous by default.</strong> comments say “anonymous” unless you choose a name. if you do, your browser signs what you write with a key that never leaves it.</li>
    <li><strong>no database.</strong> posts are files in the site's code. comments are small text files, one per comment.</li>
    <li><strong>no tracking.</strong> no analytics, no cookies, no ads, no third-party scripts. what “for you” learns stays in your browser.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>follow along</h2>
  <p>use <a href="/rss.xml">rss</a> in any feed reader. no account or email needed.</p>
  <p>to reach the person who keeps this place: <a href="mailto:asher@bosley.app">asher@bosley.app</a>.</p>
</Page>
